Package: adpcreview
Type: Package
Title: ADPC and ADNCA Concentration and Parameter Review
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Igor", "Rubets", email = "igor.rubets@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Marieve", "Dupuis", role = "aut"))
Description: Runs a local Shiny application for pharmacokinetic data review,
    with interactive findings, profile exploration, quality checks, linked
    HTML and Excel reports, and optional language model integrations.
    Source datasets are selected at runtime and are not bundled.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
